# Docs Verification Checklist

Last verified: 2025-12-05

This file maps each doc in `docs/` to the current code paths. Update both the doc and this checklist together.

## Index
- architecture.md — App + session workspace architecture and data flow
- convex.md — Schema, functions, HTTP routes, env vars
- realtime-agent.md — Session wiring, tools, auto-context, audio
- ide.md — IDE UI and execution (Pyodide) + agent tools
- notes.md — YAML lesson system and tools
- test-app.md — Legacy prototype (kept for reference)
- troubleshooting.md — Issues and remedies

## architecture.md → code
- UI
  - `app/page.tsx` + `components/Dashboard.tsx` — landing + session creation/list
  - `app/session/[sessionId]/page.tsx` — loads a session workspace
  - `components/session/SessionWorkspace.tsx` — whiteboard/IDE/notes tabs + voice agent
  - `components/spaces/*` — embeddable spaces (whiteboard, ide, lesson) used in sessions
  - `components/session/agent/*` — realtime session handle, runtime bridges, tool registry
  - Legacy: `app/test-app/**` (prototype) — see `docs/test-app.md` for minimal notes
- Backend
  - `convex/schema.ts` — users, sessions, whiteboard_sessions, ide_sessions, lesson_sessions
  - `convex/sessions.ts` — create/list/get sessions and seed per-space defaults
  - `convex/spaces.ts` — get/update whiteboard/IDE/lesson data
  - `convex/users.ts` — Clerk-backed user records
  - `convex/http.ts` — `OPTIONS|GET /realtime/token`, `POST /clerk-users-webhook`
  - `convex/realtime.ts` — `internal.realtime.mintClientSecret`
  - `app/api/realtime/token/route.ts` — Next.js proxy to Convex `/realtime/token`
- tldraw v4.0.2
  - Text shapes require `richText`; geo labels are separate text shapes
  - Unsupported geo names are normalized; allowed list in `components/session/agent/tools/whiteboard.ts`

## convex.md → code
- Schema: `convex/schema.ts` defines users + session storage tables
- Functions: `convex/users.ts`, `convex/sessions.ts`, `convex/spaces.ts`
- Endpoints: `convex/http.ts` — CORS + `GET /realtime/token`, `POST /clerk-users-webhook`
- Internal action: `convex/realtime.ts` (defaults: model `gpt-realtime`, voice `marin`)
- Env vars: `OPENAI_API_KEY`, `CLERK_WEBHOOK_SECRET`, `CLIENT_ORIGIN`, `CLERK_JWT_ISSUER_DOMAIN`
- Next.js env vars: `CONVEX_SITE_URL|NEXT_PUBLIC_CONVEX_SITE_URL|NEXT_PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL`
- Client fetch logic: `app/api/realtime/token/route.ts` → Convex `/realtime/token`

## realtime-agent.md → code
- Session connect via `components/session/SessionWorkspace.tsx` + `components/session/agent/session.ts`
- Gating: wait for `session.updated` before first response (see `SessionWorkspace`)
- Auto-context: combined JSON+image sender `components/session/services/context/index.ts` (debounce ~120ms, dedup ~300ms); fallback `components/session/services/autoContext.ts`
- Tools registry: `components/session/agent/registry.ts`; tools in `components/session/agent/tools/*`
- Approvals: `agent_clear` emits approval request and returns `approval_required`
- Audio defaults: model `gpt-realtime`, input `audio/pcm@24000` (semantic VAD create_response=false), output `audio/pcm`, voice `marin`
- Text shapes: require `props.richText`; labels are separate text shapes

