- Agent tools: `ide_create_file`, `ide_set_active`, `ide_update_content`, `ide_apply_edits`, `ide_read_code`, `ide_get_context`, `ide_run_active`
- UI: Code tab in `components/session/SessionWorkspace.tsx`

